Original images for Tenor part from Cancionero de Miranda,
P-Lant Música, liv. 122 (PT/TT/MUS/L122).

Original images under CC BY-SA 4.0 available at:

https://digitarq.arquivos.pt/fileViewer/a343c5c86e4340a0a1a05a8965d823e5

Changes: the "TT" watermark of the Arquivo Nacional Torre do Tombo has been removed from
the centre of each image by inverting its blending with the page (no pixels are painted
or reconstructed). The modified images are distributed under the same CC BY-SA 4.0 licence.
